  "notes": "{指示|しじ} refers to directions or orders given by someone in authority.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {指示|しじ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧ (give instructions)\n- {指示|しじ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧ (receive instructions)\n- {指示|しじ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{従|したが}う→従う：02059_shitagau⟧ (follow instructions)\n- {指示|しじ}{通|どお}り (as instructed)\n- {指示|しじ}⟦{書|しょ}→〜書：28467_sho⟧ (written instructions, directive)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{命令|めいれい}→命令：03754_meirei⟧: order, command (stronger)\n- ⟦{案内|あんない}→案内：01291_annai⟧: guidance, directions (gentler)",
